# T_SCRE: a level-1 user in the assembly, service and loan screens:
# the level-2 keys dimmed in the hints and refused without a request
# in the assemblies, item 1's Parts and Service tabs, the recent
# service list and its record form, the open loans and the loan form,
# and item 5's Loans tab.
S RDASSY
K INS DEL CTRL-E ALT-C M ESC CTRL-D ALT-C I ESC ALT-C T
S RDASSYF8
K ESC ENTER CTRL-E ALT-C P
S RDPARTS
K INS ALT-C I ESC ALT-C T
S RDPARTF8
K ESC ESC ALT-C S
S RDSERV
K INS CTRL-E DEL ENTER CTRL-E
S RDSERVCE
K ESC ESC ESC ESC
S RDRECENT
K CTRL-E DEL ENTER CTRL-E
S RDRECCE
K ESC ESC
S RDOPEN
K INS CTRL-E ALT-C R ESC ENTER CTRL-E
S RDOPENCE
K ESC ESC DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER ALT-C A
S RDLOANS
K INS CTRL-E ALT-C R ESC ENTER CTRL-E
S RDLOANCE
K ESC ESC ESC ESC
